+- Authoritative runtime database SHA-256 remained unchanged.
+
+## Next milestone
+
+V47.21–V47.25 should build Predictive Shift Control:
+
+- predict demand pressure ahead of the next service interval
+- combine reservations, waitlist, table availability, kitchen load, labor coverage, and revenue pace
+- identify when current staffing / table / kitchen capacity will become constrained
+- estimate time-to-constraint
+- recommend a manager intervention before the service problem happens
+- keep every intervention human-approved
